83|	// from being saved/advertised, never fatal). A pin must parse as a
84|	// harness-scoped fleet key (`harness::provider::model[::effort]`);
85|	// when the runner pins explicit harnesses WITHOUT auto-detect the
86|	// pin's harness must be one of them (auto-detect installs skip the
87|	// membership check — the final set is still unknown at load, and a
