94|/***
95| * MARK: writeRegistry
96| * @description Persists `{ roots, projects }` atomically (temp file +
97| *   rename). Parent directories are created. Never throws: a failed write
98| *   logs and reports false so adoption can still succeed in memory.
99| * @example writeRegistry({ roots: [], projects: ['/repo'] }, { registryFile: '/tmp/r.json' }) => true
100| * @param {{roots?: string[], projects?: string[]}} data
101| * @param {Object} [overrides]
102| * @param {string} [overrides.registryFile] - Explicit path (tests inject).
103| * @returns {boolean}
